{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45674","headline":"大蜀皇帝寿春节进尧铭舜颂二首 舜颂 · 贯休","name":"大蜀皇帝寿春节进尧铭舜颂二首 舜颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高高历山，有黍有粟。\n皇皇大舜，合尧玄德。\n五典克从，四门伊穆。\n大道将行，天下爲公。\n临下有赫，选贤用能。\n吾皇则之，无斁无逸。\n绥厥品汇，光光得一。\n千辐临顶，十在随跸。\n大哉大同，爲光爲龙。\n吾皇则之，圣谋隆隆。\n纳隍孜孜，考考切切。\n六宗是禋，五瑞斯列。\n排麟环凤，披香立雪。\n四夷纳賮，九围有截。\n昔救世师，降生竺乾。\n寿春亦然，万年万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}